abstract: >-
  Optimal Context Mapping scans a team's repositories once into a workspace of meaning fingerprints. It ranks the code
  and docs an AI agent should read first for a question, and it learns from every answered question, so the same
  research is not paid for twice. It ships as a Python package with hooks for Claude Code and MCP tools for other
  agents.
keywords:
